# Code owners for MyCoaster
#
# Only HIGH RISK paths are listed (see "High risk paths" in docs/REVIEW.md).
# A PR touching any of them needs the Engineer's approval, because the
# develop and main rulesets enable "Require review from Code Owners".
# Everything else has no code owner on purpose, so low-risk PRs can later
# merge without a human (Phase C).
#
# Syntax follows .gitignore: a leading "/" anchors to the repo root, a
# pattern without "/" matches at any depth. When several lines match a
# file, the LAST matching line wins.

# Auth and permissions
/apps/api/src/auth/                 @LeoTechMaze
/apps/api/src/middlewares/auth*     @LeoTechMaze
/apps/api/src/routes/auth.ts        @LeoTechMaze

# Payments
/apps/api/src/payments/             @LeoTechMaze

# Secrets and config
